*What survives the null.*

The abundance claim is contested, the assay is unvalidated, and anticoagulation has failed its one large test. Three narrower claims remain open, and each makes a different prediction. Fibrinogen chemistry may carry the signal where particle count does not. Platelet priming may coexist with normal fibrin turnover. Aggregate burden may track acute physiological stress rather than chronic disease.

